# Local working notes — decision records and debug scratch from design
# sessions. They quote real portfolio figures, so they stay out of the public
# repo. The masked prototype under design/opencode-screen/ is the artifact
# that carries the screen itself.
#
# One exception is tracked on purpose: the standalone-backend decision log
# (architecture only, no figures). Everything else under this folder stays
# local.
cooked-ideas/*
!cooked-ideas/pasar-device-a-backend-wifi.md

# Herdr subagent helper, local tooling, not part of the project
.herdr-wait-agent.sh
